  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261120150303_d87062e.jpeg\" style=\"font-size: 1rem;\"></p>\n  <p>腾讯混元正式开源首个支持视觉理解与电脑操作的多模态大模型 Hy4，提供对话、基座及 FP8 量化三个版本，在金融办公、科研及开发等真实任务场景中表现卓越。</p>\n  <div style=\"padding:0;margin:0;display:block;font-family:Microsoft YaHei,Arial,sans-serif;\">\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>腾讯混元开源&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\"><span>Hy4 正式版</span></strong><span>，这是一个支持视觉理解与电脑操作的多模态大模型，面向开发、办公、深度研究等任务。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>相比 Hy4 preview，Hy4 扩大了预训练和后训练规模，</span><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\"><span>首次引入了视觉能力</span></strong><span>，并大幅提升了指令遵循、长文理解、长程任务、深度研究等各项综合能力。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:20px 0 22px;text-align:center;\"><img alt=\"image\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261120150303_729cb5a.jpeg\"></p>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\"><span>本次开源三个版本：</span></strong></p>\n   <ul style=\"margin:12px 0 18px;padding-left:24px;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n    <li style=\"margin:7px 0;padding-left:2px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\"><span>Hy4&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">为后训练模型，用于对话与任务执行；</span></span></strong></li>\n    <li style=\"margin:7px 0;padding-left:2px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\"><span>Hy4-base&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">为预训练基座，面向后续微调与研究；</span></span></strong></li>\n    <li style=\"margin:7px 0;padding-left:2px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.75;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\"><span>Hy4-FP8&nbsp;<span style=\"font-weight: normal;\">为 FP8 量化版本，用于低精度推理部署。</span></span></strong></li>\n   </ul>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><strong style=\"font-weight:700;\"><span>开源地址：</span></strong></p>\n   <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n    <li>\n     <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>模型权重 &nbsp;</span></p>\n     <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/models/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4\" target=\"_blank\">https://modelscope.cn/models/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n    <li>\n     <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>预训练基座 &nbsp;</span></p>\n     <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/models/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4-base\" target=\"_blank\">https://modelscope.cn/models/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4-base</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n   </ul>\n   <ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\" class=\"list-paddingleft-1\">\n    <li>\n     <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>FP8 量化模型 &nbsp;</span></p>\n     <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span><a href=\"https://modelscope.cn/models/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4-FP8\" target=\"_blank\">https://modelscope.cn/models/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4-FP8</a></span></p>\n    </li>\n   </ul>\n   <div aria-label=\"章节标题\" style=\"display:block;margin:42px 0 28px;padding:0;text-align:center;\">\n    <div style=\"padding:0;margin:0;transform:skew(-10deg);-webkit-transform:skew(-10deg);display:inline-block;-moz-transform:skew(-10deg);-o-transform:skew(-10deg);box-sizing:border-box;border-bottom:1px solid #0654ea;\">\n     <div style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;margin:0;padding:5px 18px;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word!important;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;white-space:normal;transform:skew(10deg);-webkit-transform:skew(10deg);-moz-transform:skew(10deg);-o-transform:skew(10deg);\">\n      <div style=\"flex:0 0 auto;margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box!important;overflow-wrap:break-word!important;transform-style:preserve-3d;\">\n       <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;transform:translateZ(10px);max-width:100%;-webkit-transform:translateZ(10px);letter-spacing:1.5px;-moz-transform:translateZ(10px);-o-transform:translateZ(10px);box-sizing:border-box!important;overflow-wrap:break-word!important;\"><strong style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-weight:700;\"><span spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"padding:0;margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.2;\"><span>01</span></span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"padding:0 0 0 18px;margin:0;max-width:100%;flex:1 1 auto;box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:break-word!important;text-align:left;\"><strong style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-weight:700;\"><span spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:inline;font-size:17px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.35;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span>面向真实任务的应用能力</span></span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>在基础能力提升的同时，腾讯混元团队结合腾讯内部产品与业务的实际需求，持续优化 Hy4 在视觉与电脑操作、开发、金融办公、科研及个人助理等场景中的表现。</span></p>\n   <h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.01em;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;\"><span>视觉与电脑任务</span></h3>\n   <p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 16px;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0px;font-size:15px;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>Hy4 新增视觉能力，可以结合感知、推理和工具调用，完成细粒度图像处理、复杂图表分析等任务。同时，Hy4 支持电脑操作，可以结合使用命令行与图形界面。团队针对 Blender、CAD 等专业软件，以及跨应用长程任务开展专项训练，优化模型在专业任务中的规划与执行能力。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>比如，在卫星图定位任务中，用户要求找到屋顶写有“KLOOSTERBOER”的仓库，并定位其右上方光伏板区域中最东侧的白色方形构件。任务需要结合文字识别、空间关系理解和细粒度目标定位。</span></p>\n   <p></p>\n   <h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.01em;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;\"><span>前端与游戏开发</span></h3>\n   <p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 16px;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0px;font-size:15px;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>视觉理解能力的引入，也推动了 Hy4 在前端与游戏开发场景中的能力提升。针对前端开发，团队重点优化复杂交互、业务逻辑、状态管理和前后端联动，使生成的界面兼顾视觉呈现与功能可用性。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>在游戏开发场景中，腾讯混元团队与腾讯 IEG 专业游戏开发者合作，持续优化训练数据与评测质量，重点提升功能实现、玩法逻辑、状态理解和资产处理能力，适配 UE、Unity、Godot 等主流引擎，并开始扩展至多人联机游戏开发。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>相比 Hy4 preview，Hy4 在 GameDev 和 GameLogic 评测中分别提升 19.1% 和 9.8%。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>比如，“腾讯企鹅岛”任务要求使用 Three.js 构建可离线打开的单文件 HTML，将建筑、道路、海岸、植被、人车放在一个可旋转、可地面漫游的三维场景中。场景需要呈现腾云中心、云海大厦、企鹅公寓、腾讯螺旋和科技馆五组建筑，尤其要求腾讯螺旋的建筑立面自身连续回旋，而不是用外挂圆环替代。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>交互功能包括轨道观察、第一与第三人称漫游、天气昼夜、小地图、建筑详情、楼层剖切、电影导览，以及截图和录制。</span></p>\n   <p></p>\n   <h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.01em;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;\"><span>金融与办公场景</span></h3>\n   <p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 16px;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0px;font-size:15px;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>团队基于真实金融场景构建了数千个工作空间和上万个高质量任务，覆盖基金研究、证券分析、量化策略、资产配置、公司金融、财税会计等方向，让模型学习专业流程与规范。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>腾讯混元联合腾讯金融科技 FiT 开展了 213 位专家参与的金融众测，其中 153 位来自外部头部金融机构，约七成拥有五年以上工作经验。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>在 579 个真实金融任务上，Hy4 综合得分为 3.04/4，高于参与对比的 DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017（2.97/4）、Kimi K3.1 Pro（2.68/4）和 GLM-5.3（2.68/4）。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>在金融智能体公司讯兔科技的内部评测 IRAB 中，Hy4 较 Hy4 preview 提升 12.03 个百分点。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>为提升金融及其他办公任务的实用性，团队还针对时效检索、多源信息整合和事实一致性校验开展搜索优化。在自建测试中，Hy4 的幻觉率从 Hy4 preview 的 15.76% 降至 5.45%，猜测导致的错误率从 23.1% 降至 5.6%。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>Hy4 同时强化了办公场景中的人机双写能力，支持用户与模型实时协作编辑 Word、Excel、PPT 等文件。盲评显示，相比 Hy4 preview，Hy4 在文档美观度、稳定性和可用性上均有提升。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>比如，在金融估值建模任务中，用户要求使用 global-equity-research 和 neodata 制作特斯拉建模报告，交付 Excel 模型与对应的 PDF 报告，并交代估值逻辑和数字来源，结合多家机构的研究进行分析。</span></p>\n   <p></p>\n   <h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.01em;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;\"><span>科研与模型研发</span></h3>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>Hy4 将复杂推理、科学编程与长程任务执行相结合，提升端到端推进科研工作的能力。在涵盖 7 大学科、123 项可执行研究任务的 TenureTrail 内部评测中，团队公布的结果显示，Hy4 在参评开源模型中排名第一，任务覆盖数学构造、物理建模、地球环境、系统工程和社会经济决策等领域。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>团队也在为递归自我改进（RSI）做准备，提升 Hy4 在模型研发任务中的能力。结合 Hyra 2.0 脚手架，Hy4 优化了内部同架构小模型的预训练基础设施，并自动完成 Jev 模型训练。得到的 Hyra-Jev 在 8 项基准评测中有 6 项优于官方 Jev。</span></p>\n   <p style=\"margin:20px 0 22px;text-align:center;\"><img alt=\"image\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;max-width:100%;height:auto;margin:0 auto;\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20261120150303_5f6cb2a.jpeg\"></p>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>此外，团队开源了由 Hy4 协同 Hyra 2.0 研发的单细胞表征基础模型 HyCell 和物理场基础模型 HyPDE，将模型辅助科研的成果提供给社区复用。</span></p>\n   <h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.01em;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;\"><span>长期个人助理</span></h3>\n   <p style=\"padding:0px;margin:0px 0px 16px;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0px;font-size:15px;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, 微软雅黑, Arial, sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>Hy4 持续提升上下文学习能力，以理解来自不同来源的复杂信息。借助 WorkBuddy 的企业微信套件，Hy4 可以连通聊天记录、邮件、文档、日程与会议等日常工作信息。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>当多个项目并行推进时，Hy4 可以梳理各项目的推进历史与最新进展，识别待跟进任务、需要准备的会议和临近截止的事项，提醒用户并协助安排优先级。团队还介绍，由 Hy4 支撑的团队协作功能将随新版“项目”在 WorkBuddy 上线。</span><span> \n     <br> \n    </span><span>比如，“Daily Focus”任务要求综合聊天记录、邮件、日历、会议和文档，生成可离线打开的单文件交互式 HTML 每日事项看板。看板不是逐条复述消息，而是跨来源去重、整合值得关注的事项，按重要性和紧急性排序，并用通俗语言说明每件事发生了什么、当前进展以及下一步需要做什么。</span></p>\n   <p></p>\n   <div aria-label=\"章节标题\" style=\"display:block;margin:42px 0 28px;padding:0;text-align:center;\">\n    <div style=\"padding:0;margin:0;transform:skew(-10deg);-webkit-transform:skew(-10deg);display:inline-block;-moz-transform:skew(-10deg);-o-transform:skew(-10deg);box-sizing:border-box;border-bottom:1px solid #0654ea;\">\n     <div style=\"-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent;margin:0;padding:5px 18px;box-sizing:border-box;overflow-wrap:break-word!important;display:flex;align-items:flex-start;white-space:normal;transform:skew(10deg);-webkit-transform:skew(10deg);-moz-transform:skew(10deg);-o-transform:skew(10deg);\">\n      <div style=\"flex:0 0 auto;margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box!important;overflow-wrap:break-word!important;transform-style:preserve-3d;\">\n       <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;transform:translateZ(10px);max-width:100%;-webkit-transform:translateZ(10px);letter-spacing:1.5px;-moz-transform:translateZ(10px);-o-transform:translateZ(10px);box-sizing:border-box!important;overflow-wrap:break-word!important;\"><strong style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-weight:700;\"><span spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"padding:0;margin:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.2;\"><span>02</span></span></strong></p>\n      </div>\n      <p style=\"padding:0 0 0 18px;margin:0;max-width:100%;flex:1 1 auto;box-sizing:border-box;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:break-word!important;text-align:left;\"><strong style=\"margin:0;padding:0;font-weight:700;\"><span spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:inline;font-size:17px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.35;overflow-wrap:anywhere;\"><span>本地部署与推理</span></span></strong></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>Hy4 当前支持 vLLM 和 SGLang 部署，提供 BF16、FP8 指令模型及 base 预训练模型。官方部署方案主要使用 FP8 权重，支持 8 张 H200/B200 或 4 张 B300/GB300；以下采用 8 卡配置。</span></p>\n   <h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.01em;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;\"><span>下载模型</span></h3>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>安装 ModelScope，并根据用途选择权重：</span></p>\n   <div style=\"border-radius:4px;padding:16px 18px;margin:20px 0;white-space:normal;display:block;overflow-x:auto;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>pip install modelscope</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span># BF16 指令模型</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>modelscope download Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4 \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --local-dir Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span># FP8 指令模型</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>modelscope download Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4-FP8 \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --local-dir Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4-FP8</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span># 预训练基础模型</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>modelscope download Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4-base \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --local-dir Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4-base</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>以下服务示例使用 FP8 指令模型：</span></p>\n   <div style=\"border-radius:4px;padding:16px 18px;margin:20px 0;white-space:normal;display:block;overflow-x:auto;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>export MODEL_DIR=\"$PWD/Tencent-Hunyuan/Hy4-FP8\"</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.01em;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;\"><span>vLLM 服务部署</span></h3>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>拉取 Hy4 专用镜像：</span></p>\n   <div style=\"border-radius:4px;padding:16px 18px;margin:20px 0;white-space:normal;display:block;overflow-x:auto;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>docker pull vllm/vllm-openai:hy4</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>挂载本地 FP8 权重并启动服务：</span></p>\n   <div style=\"border-radius:4px;padding:16px 18px;margin:20px 0;white-space:normal;display:block;overflow-x:auto;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>docker run --gpus all \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --privileged --ipc=host \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; -p 127.0.0.1:8000:8000 \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --mount \"type=bind,src=$MODEL_DIR,dst=/model,readonly\" \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; -e VLLM_USE_RUST_FRONTEND=1 \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; vllm/vllm-openai:hy4 /model \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --dtype bfloat16 \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --limit-mm-per-prompt '{\"image\":1,\"video\":0}' \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --tensor-parallel-size 8 \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --enable-auto-tool-choice \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --reasoning-parser hy_v4 \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --tool-call-parser hy_v4 \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --speculative-config '{\"num_speculative_tokens\":5,\"method\":\"dfly\"}' \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --attention-backend FLASHMLA_SPARSE \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --served-model-name hy4</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>默认每个请求最多输入一张图片，不启用视频输入，可根据显存调整&nbsp;</span><code style=\"border-radius:3px;padding:1px 5px;font-size:.92em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;\"><span>--limit-mm-per-prompt</span></code><span>。</span></p>\n   <h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.01em;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;\"><span>SGLang 服务部署</span></h3>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>拉取支持 x86 和 Arm 的专用镜像：</span></p>\n   <div style=\"border-radius:4px;padding:16px 18px;margin:20px 0;white-space:normal;display:block;overflow-x:auto;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>docker pull lmsysorg/sglang:hy4</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>使用本地 FP8 权重启动服务：</span></p>\n   <div style=\"border-radius:4px;padding:16px 18px;margin:20px 0;white-space:normal;display:block;overflow-x:auto;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>docker run --gpus all --ipc=host \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; -p 127.0.0.1:8000:8000 \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; --mount \"type=bind,src=$MODEL_DIR,dst=/model,readonly\" \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; lmsysorg/sglang:hy4 \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; sglang serve \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; --model-path /model \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; --tp 8 \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; --reasoning-parser auto \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; --tool-call-parser auto \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; --speculative-algorithm DFLY \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; --host 0.0.0.0 \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; --port 8000 \\</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; --served-model-name hy4</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <h3 style=\"margin:28px 0 12px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.01em;font-size:17px;line-height:1.55;\"><span>OpenAI 兼容 API 调用</span></h3>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>安装客户端：</span></p>\n   <div style=\"border-radius:4px;padding:16px 18px;margin:20px 0;white-space:normal;display:block;overflow-x:auto;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>pip install openai</span></p>\n   </div>\n   <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;word-break:break-word;display:block;letter-spacing:0;font-size:15px;font-family:'Microsoft YaHei','微软雅黑',Arial,sans-serif;line-height:1.75;text-align:left;\"><span>vLLM 与 SGLang 选择一种启动后，即可通过统一接口调用：</span></p>\n   <div style=\"border-radius:4px;padding:16px 18px;margin:20px 0;white-space:normal;display:block;overflow-x:auto;box-sizing:border-box;\">\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>from openai import OpenAI</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>client = OpenAI(</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; base_url=\"<a href=\"http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1\" target=\"_blank\">http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1</a>\",</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; api_key=\"EMPTY\",</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>)</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>response = client.chat.completions.create(</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; model=\"hy4\",</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; messages=[</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; {\"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"简要解释稀疏注意力的作用。\"},</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; ],</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; temperature=0,</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; max_tokens=2048,</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; extra_body={</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"chat_template_kwargs\": {</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; \"reasoning_effort\": \"no_think\"</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; }</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>&nbsp; &nbsp; },</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>)</span></p>\n    <p style=\"padding:0;margin:0;white-space:nowrap;display:block;font-size:13px;min-height:1.7em;font-family:SFMono-Regular,Consolas,'Liberation Mono',Menlo,monospace;line-height:1.7;\"><span>print(response.choices[0].message.content)</span></p>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">点击</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;font-weight: bold;\">阅读原文</span><span style=\"font-size: 15px;\">，即可跳转模型合集~</span></span></p>\n  <div style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;margin:0px;letter-spacing:0.544px;display:block;text-decoration-style:initial;font-style:normal;text-transform:none;font-variant-ligatures:normal;widows:2;\">\n   <hr style=\"font-variant-caps:normal;white-space:normal;font-weight:400;font-size:17px;box-sizing:border-box !important;text-decoration-thickness:initial;overflow-wrap:break-word !important;-webkit-tap-highlight-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);outline:0px;word-spacing:0px;transform:scale(1, 0.5);text-indent:0px;font-family:&quot;PingFang SC&quot;, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Hiragino Sans GB&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei UI&quot;, &quot;Microsoft YaHei&quot;, Arial, sans-serif;border-width:1px 0px 0px;orphans:2;text-decoration-color:initial;border-style:solid;text-align:justify;-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;padding:0px;ma